### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@authToken = {{verifyOtp.response.body.token}}

### ========================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ========================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION (Login / Register)
### ========================================

### Step 2.1: Request OTP
# This will log a 4-digit code in the terminal
# @name requestOtp
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/request-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+967770000001"
}


### Step 2.2: Verify OTP
# Replace '1234' with the code you saw in the terminal output
# @name verifyOtp
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+967770000001",
  "otpCode": "1234" 
}

### ========================================
### 3. TAXONOMY (Categories & Locations)
### ========================================

### Get all locations (Governorates and Cities)
GET {{baseUrl}}/taxonomy/locations

### Get all categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/taxonomy/categories


### ========================================
### 4. PRODUCTS
### ========================================

### Get all approved products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Get single product (Replace with actual ID from the list above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_ID


### ========================================
### 5. BUSINESS PROFILES
### ========================================

### Create / Update Business Profile
# (Note: You must grab a cityId from the Taxonomy/Locations response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/business
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary123

--Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="businessName"

حلويات السعادة
--Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

أفضل الحلويات المنزلية في صنعاء
--Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="contactPhone"

+967770000001
--Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cityId"

REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_CITY_ID
--Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="logo"; filename="dummy.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./dummy.jpg
--Boundary123--


### ========================================
### 6. UPLOAD PRODUCT
### ========================================

### Create a new Product (Will be PENDING)
# (Note: You must grab a categoryId from the Taxonomy/Categories response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary456

--Boundary456
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

كيكة الفراولة
--Boundary456
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

كيكة لذيذة بالفراولة الطازجة
--Boundary456
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

4000
--Boundary456
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="unitOfSale"

حبة
--Boundary456
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryId"

REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_CATEGORY_ID
--Boundary456
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="productImages"; filename="dummy.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./dummy.jpg
--Boundary456--


### ========================================
### 7. USER INTERACTIONS (Favorites & Reviews)
### ========================================

### Toggle Favorite Product
POST {{baseUrl}}/interactions/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID"
}

### Get My Favorites
GET {{baseUrl}}/interactions/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Add Review
POST {{baseUrl}}/interactions/review
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "طعم رائع جداً وتوصيل سريع!"
}

### ========================================
### 8. USER & REPORTS
### ========================================

### Submit a Report
POST {{baseUrl}}/interactions/report
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetType": "PRODUCT",
  "targetId": "REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID",
  "reason": "صورة المنتج غير لائقة أو السعر مبالغ فيه"
}

### Register Device Token (For Push Notifications)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/device-token
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fcmToken": "mock_fcm_token_1234567890",
  "devicePlatform": "ANDROID"
}

### ========================================
### 9. ADMIN PANEL
### ========================================

### 9.1: Request Admin OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/request-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+967770000999" 
}

### 9.2: Verify Admin OTP
# @name verifyAdminOtp
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+967770000999",
  "otpCode": "1234" 
}

### Variables for Admin Auth
@adminToken = {{verifyAdminOtp.response.body.token}}

### Get all Pending Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/products/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve a Product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/products/REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get all Pending Reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### View Admin Audit Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
